&oh=00_AQKNv-68gcPhH0bjrC_5-xictD7Fqps9X-3EfCqasFD9ew&oe=6AB3E47D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "664149641982555", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974554_664149645315888_1329152045526098657_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rTIVyiI_YR8Q7kNvwGoK4cq&_nc_oc=AdqKmNYRPLm2LCnssmr7cOq3QRlCDtZ-YXqv58TIizVwVMrgtsnXZkWGwFGPFkgKIVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ8ufjbWBtxUEHS-FPfS4uOUzs4OY7Go5xpULc5Us-4wA&oe=6AB3D5E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Touchly Volumetric VR Video Player", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Touchly is the next evolution of the VR video player.\nWith its own volumetric video format, it makes it possible to:\n\n-Boost inmersion with virtual hands that react to the video environment, haptic feedback included.\n-Watch in six-degrees-of-freedom: Reduce eye strain and move freely with position tracking.\n-Passthrough mode: Bring videos to your reality.\n\nOn top of that Touchly supports most of the common layouts (180/360/Flat in Stereo/Mono) and formats (mp4, avi, mkv, mov, webm).\n\nImportant note: To watch videos in volumetric mode, they need to be converted first with Touchly Renderer (touchly.app/renderer). Only a couple of demo videos are included in the app.", "short_description": "Touchly is the next evolution of the VR video player.\nWith its own volumetric video format, it makes it possible to:\n\n-Boost inmersion with virtual hands that react to the video environment, haptic feedback included.\n-Watch in six-degrees-of-freedom: Reduce eye strain and move freely with position tracking.\n-Passthrough mode: Bring videos to your reality.\n\nOn top of that, Touchly supports most of the common VR layouts (180/360/Flat in Stereo/Mono)."}]}, "developer_name": "Touchly", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://touchly.app/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Touchly", "support_websit